  "releaseNotes": "[8.3.1] - 2026-05-18\n      - Reworked transaction exceptions from DbException to TransactionException for clarity\n      [8.3.0] - 2026-05-13\n      - SaveChanges now uses result objects\n      - Reduction of heap allocations\n      - New converters\n      - Fixed datatypes comparisons\n      [8.2.0] - 2026-04-19\n      - Added custom exception for transaction rollback errors\n      [8.1.2] - 2026-02-09\n      - Added overloads for InTransaction and InTransactionAsync for return by value\n      [8.1.0] - 2026-01-11\n      - IUnitOfWork is now disposable\n      - IUnitOfWork no longer contains Attach/Detach methods\n      - IRepository now contains Attach/Detach methods\n      - IDbError implementations now as classes instead of structs",
